          ]
        },
        "201970005": {
          "id": 201970005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "I wanna challenge myself a bit",
          "next": [
            201970006
          ]
        },
        "201970006": {
          "id": 201970006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "Want some?",
          "next": [
            201970007,
            201970008,
            201970010
          ]
        },
        "201970007": {
          "id": 201970007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Yes, chef. I'll eat anything",
          "next": [
            201970012
          ]
        },
        "201970008": {
          "id": 201970008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Chef, can I eat everything on the menus you sent?",
          "next": [
            201970009
          ]
        },
        "201970009": {
          "id": 201970009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "If you can eat it all, then be my guest",
          "next": [
            201970012
          ]
        },
        "201970010": {
          "id": 201970010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Let Chef Mydei work his magic!",
          "next": [
            201970011
          ]
        },
        "201970011": {
          "id": 201970011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "Alright.",
          "next": [
            201970012
          ]
        },
        "201970012": {
          "id": 201970012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "Let's start with <i>Kremnos' Late Night Diner</i>",
          "next": [
            201970013
          ]
        },
        "201970013": {
          "id": 201970013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "Although I've tried all the recipes and styles on the menu, Kremnoan cuisine is definitely my specialty",
          "next": [
            201970014,
            201970015,
            201970016
          ]
        },
        "201970014": {
          "id": 201970014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Venison heart tartare?",
          "next": [
            201970017
          ]
        },
        "201970015": {
          "id": 201970015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Grilled lizard legs?",
          "next": [
            201970017
          ]
        },
        "201970016": {
          "id": 201970016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Is it an acquired taste?",
          "next": [
            201970017
          ]
        },
        "201970017": {
          "id": 201970017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "Seems like you've got us Kremnoans all wrong",
          "next": [
            201970018
          ]
        },
        "201970018": {
          "id": 201970018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "Those were just outdated customs that Kremnoans used to test warriors, which I've abolished long ago",
          "next": [
            201970019
          ]
        },
        "201970019": {
          "id": 201970019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "Nowadays, Kremnoan cuisine is all about nutritionally balanced and healthy food",
          "next": [
            201970020
          ]
        },
        "201970020": {
          "id": 201970020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "It also absorbed and incorporated the best elements from other cuisines to create something new and improved",
          "next": [
            201970021
          ]
        },
        "201970021": {
          "id": 201970021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "Do you have any taste preferences?",
          "next": [
            201970022,
            201970024,
            201970026
          ]
        },
        "201970022": {
          "id": 201970022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "I just love stuff with an acquired taste.",
          "next": [
            201970023
          ]
        },
        "201970023": {
          "id": 201970023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "Then let's go with braised cloudsheep ribs in soy sauce. This dish is great for replenishing salt and stimulating appetite. Best paired with pomegranate juice.",
          "next": [
            201970031
          ]
        },
        "201970024": {
          "id": 201970024,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "I'd like some normal food",
          "next": [
            201970025
          ]
        },
        "201970025": {
          "id": 201970025,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "Sour bean paste with pomegranate honeycake. That's a winning combo any time",
          "next": [
            201970031
          ]
        },
        "201970026": {
          "id": 201970026,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "I'm not eating anything that doesn't taste weird",
          "next": [
            201970027
          ]
        },
        "201970027": {
          "id": 201970027,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "In that case, canned fish from the Sea of Souls might be what you're looking for",
          "next": [
            201970028
          ]
        },
        "201970028": {
          "id": 201970028,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "I rarely use it for cooking",
          "next": [
            201970029
          ]
        },
        "201970029": {
          "id": 201970029,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "Or I could go get some meat that's been stored for over ten years",
          "next": [
            201970030
          ]
        },
        "201970030": {
          "id": 201970030,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "That smell will definitely haunt you forever",
          "next": [
            201970031
          ]
        },
        "201970031": {
          "id": 201970031,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "next": [
            201970032
          ]
        },
        "201970032": {
          "id": 201970032,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "There's a popular saying in Castrum Kremnos: \"A soldier who wishes to become a General must first be an excellent chef\"",
          "next": [
            201970033
          ]
        },
        "201970033": {
          "id": 201970033,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "So, trust my cooking and combination skills",
          "next": [
            201970034
          ]
        },
        "201970034": {
          "id": 201970034,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "Bon appétit!",
          "next": []
        }
      },
